& \text { Now, shape factor } \quad \begin{aligned}
S & =\frac{M_{P}}{M_{y}}=\frac{f_{y} Z_{p}}{f_{y} Z_{e}} \\
& =\frac{9750 \mathrm{~mm}^{3}}{5385.135 \mathrm{~mm}^{3}} \\
S & =1.81
\end{aligned} 
\end{aligned}
[/latex]

